message: "If you use keyleash, please cite it as below."
title: keyleash
abstract: >-
  Local API-key wallet for AI providers: keys stay in an encrypted vault and tools get
  scoped, budgeted, machine-local passes, with spend limits checked before each request
  is sent, a presence lock and a hash-chained audit log.
